# Build profile for the Slate deployment ONLY.
#
# Slate hosts static files, so the frontend deployed there has no API on its own
# origin and must call the AppSail service across origins. The AppSail build
# uses .env.appsail instead, which leaves this empty so it stays same-origin.
#
# Not a secret — it is a public URL, and Vite inlines VITE_* into the bundle at
# build time regardless. The API authorises by Catalyst session, not by URL
# obscurity.
#
# Leave this unset for local dev (Vite proxies /api to :3001) and for the
# AppSail deployment itself, which serves the frontend from its own origin.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://hitlist-api-50045941899.development.catalystappsail.in
